In addtion to the help offered by the general help system, help is available
for most of Soft-Span's commands.  To get help on a command, enter a command 
at the main menu of the format:

              HELP <COMMAND>

Where <COMMAND> is the command name.  You may inquire about either a primary
command or an alias.  If you do select an alias, you will be told the primary
command's name and be given help on the primary command.  Everything that
applies to the primary command also applies to its aliases.
